WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
On a roadside, a blind man shouts: Jesus,

2
00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.740
you son of David, have mercy on me!

3
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:12.500
At the cross, a Roman soldier says:
Truly this man was the Son of God!

4
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.660
Peter calls him the Christ.

5
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:18.110
But Jesus' favourite name
for himself is stranger:

6
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.720
the Son of Man.

7
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.180
So why did his followers
need so many names for him?

8
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:27.600
In this mission, you'll find out what
Jews in Jesus' time hoped a Messiah would

9
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:28.510
be.

10
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.930
Then you'll read what Jesus says will
happen when they go up to Jerusalem.

11
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:37.880
Your mission: find out why Jesus'
followers needed so many names for him.
